Source landscape note: Egypt in 2023 produced a dense conflict-facing paper trail around Gaza mediation, Sudan spillover, Nile/GERD diplomacy, military exercises, and military/resource signaling. I found a broad mix of official Egyptian statements, UN/ICRC/WHO/WFP records, SIPRI materials, NGO reporting, and Reuters-based coverage; most are `unopened` discovery leads, with some Arabic official pages and some mirrored Reuters items that may need later access handling.

